      "assessment": "The scanner labels readSync a path sink, but line 94 passes an already opened numeric descriptor. The local CLI-selected Python executable runs only the fixed -I -B -c bridge. That bridge enumerates local PROFILES and returns a row only after certification_result enforces a strict exchange identifier, matching profile and pinned receipt. The final receipt path uses that exchange under a fixed directory. stableBytes checks a canonical parent, ordinary non-symlink single-link file and byte limit; it opens read-only with O_NOFOLLOW where available and checks descriptor/file identity before, during and after the read. The renewed pin changes receipt bytes only, not the path flow."
